---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Talks"
  description="Previous talks, presentations, and related blog posts featuring Brian Scott on engineering, reliability, and AI governance."
>
  <h1>Talks</h1>
  <p class="intro">Stories and lessons from building reliable systems and teams.</p>

  <section aria-labelledby="blog-posts">
    <h2 id="blog-posts" class="section-label">Blog posts</h2>
    <article aria-labelledby="adobe-ai-governance">
      <h3 id="adobe-ai-governance">
        <a href="https://itrevolution.com/articles/generative-ai-governance-at-scale-lessons-from-adobe/">Generative AI Governance at Scale: Lessons from Adobe</a>
      </h3>
      <p class="post-meta">IT Revolution &middot; <time datetime="2024-06-26">June 26, 2024</time> &middot; By Leah Brown</p>
      <p>
        A write-up of my presentation with Daniel Neff at the 2024 Enterprise
        Technology Leadership Summit Virtual Europe. It explores Adobe's approach
        to generative AI governance, including the A&ndash;F Framework, risk-based
        reviews, and balancing innovation with responsible adoption.
      </p>
      <p class="talk-links">
        <a href="https://itrevolution.com/articles/generative-ai-governance-at-scale-lessons-from-adobe/">Read the article</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true"> &middot; </span>
        <a href="https://videos.itrevolution.com/watch/941702633">Watch the presentation</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="previous-talks">
    <h2 id="previous-talks" class="section-label">Previous talks</h2>

    <article aria-labelledby="disney-global-sre">
      <h3 id="disney-global-sre">Disney Global SRE &mdash; Creating Digital Magic</h3>
      <p class="post-meta">DevOps Enterprise Summit Europe &middot; <time datetime="2022">2022</time></p>
      <p>
        From my time at The Walt Disney Company: a look at scaling our Global SRE
        practice, fostering communities of practice, and building the technology
        and automation behind digital guest experiences.
      </p>
      <p class="speakers">Presented with Alexi Varanko and Jason Cox.</p>

      <figure>
        <iframe
          src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/BqYH3aCxLA4"
          title="Disney Global SRE — Creating Digital Magic, with Brian Scott, Alexi Varanko, and Jason Cox"
          width="640"
          height="360"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
        <figcaption>
          A 7-minute excerpt, published by IT Revolution on
          <time datetime="2022-07-07">July 7, 2022</time>.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <p class="talk-links">
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BqYH3aCxLA4">Watch on YouTube</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true"> &middot; </span>
        <a href="https://videos.itrevolution.com/watch/709121287/">Full talk (31 minutes; free account required)</a>
      </p>
    </article>
    <article aria-labelledby="srecon22">
      <h3 id="srecon22">Disney Global SRE &mdash; Creating Digital Magic</h3>
      <p class="post-meta">SREcon22 Americas &middot; <time datetime="2022-03-15">March 15, 2022</time></p>
      <p>
        How Disney scaled its SRE practice across the enterprise, with stories of
        successes, setbacks, and the technology and automation behind large-scale
        platforms and digital experiences.
      </p>
      <p class="speakers">Presented with Jason Cox and Alexi Varanko.</p>
      <p class="talk-links">
        <a href="https://www.usenix.org/conference/srecon22americas/presentation/cox">Talk details at USENIX</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true"> &middot; </span>
        <a href="https://www.usenix.org/conference/srecon22americas/speaker-or-organizer/brian-scott-walt-disney-company">Speaker profile</a>
      </p>
    </article>

    <article aria-labelledby="scale17">
      <h3 id="scale17">Making Digital Magic at Disney</h3>
      <p class="post-meta">SCALE 17x &middot; <time datetime="2019-03-09">March 9, 2019</time></p>
      <p>
        How Disney's SRE teams empowered developers and product teams with
        self-service automation and foundations built on best practices.
      </p>
      <p class="speakers">Presented with Patrick O'Connor and Jason Cox.</p>
      <p class="talk-links">
        <a href="https://www.socallinuxexpo.org/scale/17x/presentations/making-digital-magic-disney/index.html">Talk details at SCALE</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true"> &middot; </span>
        <a href="https://www.socallinuxexpo.org/scale/17x/speakers/brian-scott/">Speaker profile</a>
      </p>
    </article>

    <article aria-labelledby="go-at-disney">
      <h3 id="go-at-disney">Go at Disney</h3>
      <p class="post-meta">GopherCon &middot; <time datetime="2017">2017</time></p>
      <p>A talk from my time at Disney, presented at GopherCon 2017.</p>
      <figure>
        <iframe
          src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/OMhXJD54ZDM"
          title="GopherCon 2017: Go at Disney — Brian Scott"
          width="640"
          height="360"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
        <figcaption>
          An 8-minute recording, published by Gopher Academy on
          <time datetime="2017-07-24">July 24, 2017</time>.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <p class="talk-links"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OMhXJD54ZDM">Watch on YouTube</a></p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  article {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  article h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs);
  }

  article + article {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .speakers {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  iframe {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--panel);
  }

  figcaption,
  .talk-links {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .talk-links {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }
</style>
